  "version": "0.33.0",
  "notes": "### New\n\n- **HTML files in Organisational context** — shared HTML documents now show up alongside your other organisational context files.\n- **Keep working when the shared folder is offline** — new sessions now start from your last saved baseline instead of failing, with a clear notice while saving is unavailable.\n\n### Improved\n\n- **Automatic agent updates** — Palette now checks its managed agent tools for updates when you open the app and when you switch back to it.\n- **Minimum versions for your own installs** — if you already have an agent CLI installed, Palette only uses it when it's new enough to work properly, instead of silently running an incompatible version.\n\n### Fixed\n\n- **Permission prompts** — reading files no longer asks for approval every time, and plan mode correctly blocks edits again.\n- **Codex model list** — the models you can pick now match the Codex version Palette is actually running.\n- **Slack community link** — the invite in Help works again.",
